docs {
  # Get Crystal Bands

  This endpoint retrieves every crystal band in the tenant's seed catalog.

  ## Response

  ```json
  {
    "data": [
      {
        "id": "1",
        "type": "crystalBands",
        "attributes": {
          "maxLevel": 40,
          "crystalItemId": 4260000,
          "count": 1
        }
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
}
